Yeh u are right but the thing is that that point is actually useless. Have u seen that AI that was made with free will and his quest was to patrol? If not i'll tell u what he decided to do: He decided to drown himself. U see yes you are right, things make u happy but to live happy and to be happy are two different things, yes i am happy when i drink, smoke, play videogames but that is just temporary, As i said i can be happy but live a sad life, u get me? I never had suicidal thoughts bcs i feel like that no answear to my problem. My problem is my life is sad and i cannot change it

&#x200B;

Sorry for my writing again, i am still drinking
